{"strongs": "H7394", "word": "רֵכָב", "translit": "re.khav", "root": "רכב", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "band of riders?", "definition": "רֵכָב proper name, masculine ( band of riders? compare Arabic camels used in journeying ); — 1. Πηχαβ : \\ \\ a. in ׳ יְהוֺנָדָב בֶּןרֿ (Jehu's time, see ׳ יְהו ) 2Kgs 10:15 ; 2Kgs 10:13 , whose descendants [or, the members of whose society, RS K 15 , yet see Nö ZMG xi (1886). 171 ] were contemporary with Jeremiah, Jer 35:6 ; Jer 35:8 ; Jer 35:14 ; Jer 35:16 ; Jer 35:19 ; 1Chr 2:55 הַקִּינִים (see קֵינִי ) are said to be descended from „mmath , אֲבִי בֵיתרֵֿכָב . — On the asceticism of different tribes compare Diod xix.94 (Nabataeans), Palmer Desert 432 ( Kheibari Jews in Arabia); see also Berthol Stellung Israel Zu d, Freemden 80 . \\ \\ b. (perhaps= a , so Emey Entstehung 147 ) in ׳ מַלְכִּיָּה בֶןרֿ Neh 3:14 . 2. in Benjamin, 2Sam 4:2 ( πηχαβ ), v 2Sam 4:3 v 2Sam 4:6 v 2Sam 4:9 ( πεκχα ; A ᵐ5 L Πηχαβ in all).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7923')\">BDB7923</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7394')\">H7394</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7922')\">BDB7922</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7924')\">BDB7924</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>רֵכָב</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>band of riders?</highlight> compare Arabic <placeholder5069/> <highlight>camels used in journeying</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <grk>Πηχαβ</grk>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> in <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהוֺנָדָב בֶּןרֿ</bdbheb> (Jehu's time, see <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יְהו</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,15)\">2Kgs 10:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,13)\">2Kgs 10:13</ref>, whose descendants [or, the members of whose society, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RS')\